{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:d2d53293678e2381","name":"The Virago","source":{"id":"source:reference-d2d53293678e2381","title":"The Virago","revision":18829,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:48:36Z","sha256":"9b37262ec66fe4700acce43c775821b9a1ea3ceba825e3e2c9996354d60ed314","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18829","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=The%20Virago&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-d2d53293678e2381","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Black Sun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Black_Sun","referenceId":"reference:5c22b34bff28e06d"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Virago"]}," was the personal Starship of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Prince Xizor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Prince_Xizor","referenceId":"reference:9b9b101354304ddd"},", Black Sun's Underlord. He personally commissioned MandalMotors to design a unique ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"}," for his personal use. Xizor's demands were steep; he required a ship that could match the ",{"tag":"a","children":["TIE Interceptor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/TIE_Interceptor","referenceId":"reference:d62c9e17ed58a2d1"}," in speed and that was both versatile and combat-capable. The spacecraft that was produced as a result was the first ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["StarViper"]},"-Class Attack Platform"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/StarViper-Class_Attack_Platform","referenceId":"reference:4210a2d581f1873c"},", and the criminal prince christened his ship The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Virago"]},". To ensure that his ship remained unique and unrivaled, Xizor purchased all rights to the new design.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Viago"]}," served Xizor well for many years, paying for itself many times over. It was eventually lost over ",{"tag":"a","children":["Coruscant"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Coruscant","referenceId":"reference:2ee37a21e9e7a955"}," when Xizor's skyhook was destroyed by the Imperial Super Star Destroyer ",{"tag":"i","children":["Executor"]},". MandalMotors wasted little time in regaining the rights to the ",{"tag":"i","children":["StarViper"]}," design following Xizor's death. The newest iteration of the ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["StarViper"]},"-Class Attack Platform"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/StarViper-Class_Attack_Platform","referenceId":"reference:4210a2d581f1873c"}," is not as fast or as agile as Xizor's original prototype, but MandalMotors felt that some concessions were unavoidable in order to bring the price into line with the market as a whole.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Virago"]}," Statistics (CL 12)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Gargantuan ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +3; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 19 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 12), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"http